---
layout: base.njk
pagination:
  data: contentData.series
  size: 1
  alias: series
permalink: "/series/{{ series.slug }}/"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ series.title }}"
---
{% from "components.njk" import storyCard, filterBar %}
{% set previewCount = (series.stories | length) - (series.publishedStories | length) %}
{% set insurance = series.slug == 'family-protection' or '保障' in series.title %}
<div class="container page-main"><nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="面包屑"><a href="{{ '/' | url }}">首页</a><span>/</span><span aria-current="page">{{ series.title }}</span></nav><header class="page-header"><p class="eyebrow">场景系列 {{ '%02d' | format(series.order) }}</p><h1>{{ series.title }}</h1><p class="lead">{{ series.summary }}</p>{% if series.descriptionHtml %}{{ series.descriptionHtml | safe }}{% endif %}<span class="small">可读 {{ series.publishedStories | length }} 篇 · 预告 {{ previewCount }} 篇</span></header>
{% if series.publishedStories.length or previewCount %}
{{ filterBar(series.slug, false, contentData.series, taxonomy.axes.tags.items, series.coverage.tags, series.coverage.levels, series.publishedStories | length, previewCount) }}
<section data-published-list><h2>已发布</h2>{% if series.publishedStories.length %}<div class="story-list" data-filter-list>{% for story in series.publishedStories %}{{ storyCard(story, contentData.series) }}{% endfor %}</div>{% else %}<p class="small">还没有可读正文。</p>{% endif %}</section>
{% if previewCount %}<details class="preview-block" data-preview-block open><summary>接下来 · 预告 {{ previewCount }} 篇</summary><div class="story-list" data-filter-list>{% for story in series.stories %}{% if story.planned %}{{ storyCard(story, contentData.series) }}{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div></details>{% endif %}
<div class="empty-state" data-empty hidden><h2>没有符合条件的{{ '理念' if series.format == 'brief' else '故事' }}</h2><p>试试减少标签，或把难度切回「全部」。筹备中的选项不会打开空列表。</p><button type="button" class="button" data-clear-filters>清除标签与难度</button></div>
{% else %}<div class="empty-state"><h2>{% if insurance %}保障专题 · 筹备中{% else %}筹备中{% endif %}</h2><p>这一场景还没有可读正文。可以先读已经发布的场景。</p><a class="button" href="{{ '/series/first-paycheck/' | url }}">先读《三个罐子》所在的系列</a></div>{% endif %}</div>
